<b>I ordered Special Offer. See below for details.</b>

Special Offer: 1000MB, 40GB, As low as $2.95

Standard Plan: 500MB, 25GB, As low as $4.95

Executive Plan: 2000MB, 80GB, As low as $9.95

Reseller Pro Plan: 20GB, 200GB, As low as $39.95

30-day money back guarantee. Price lock. Domain name registration: $15. Live support online (I don't know yet what that entails.), Ticket system (I sent a 'low' priority, non-tech question to 'not yet a customer' and got an email answer in 30 minutes.

<b>Details: Limited Time Special Offer</b>

My cost was $110.80: 2 yrs domain registration at $15 per yr was $30 + 24mos package at $70.80 ($2.95/mo) + set-up fee of $10.

<b>Features:</b>

Short:

1000 MB Disk Space, 40 GB Bandwidth, Sub-Domains, Unlimited Email, POP3/SMTP/IMAP  <nowiki>WebMail </nowiki>Access, SPAM Assassin, <nowiki>MySQL</nowiki> & PHP, Perl & CGI-Bin, 24/7 FTP Access, Web File Manager, Web Control Panel, Pre-installed Scripts, MS <nowiki>FrontPage</nowiki> Ext's, As low as $2.95 (35.40).

As low as $2.95 comes from a chart for length of contract. One month was $6.95, IIRC, and $2.95 was for 24 months.

Long:

Account Benefits: Disk Space: 1000MB, Bandwidth: 40GB/mo, eMail Accounts: Unlimited, Sub Domains: Unlimited, Static IP.

Account Control: CPanel 8 - Control Panel, Change Password, Full Site Backup Protection, Viewable Access Logs, Viewable Bandwidth Usage, SSH / Telnet Acess, IP Deny Manager.

Account Management: File Manager, Custom Error Pages, Define MIME Types, Apache Handlers, Password Protect Folders, MS <nowiki>FrontPage</nowiki> Extensions, Manage Redirects, View Server Status , Cron Jobs.

Data Bases: <nowiki>MySQL</nowiki> 4.0.15, Manage Users, <nowiki>PHPMyAdmin</nowiki>.

Integration: Interchange Shopping Cart, Agora Shopping Cart, Pre-Installed CGI Scripts, Fantastico Auto-Installer, Pre-Installed Add-On Scripts, Viewable Error Logs.

Email Features: POP3 Mail, SMTP Mail, Email Aliases, Email Forwarders, Email Auto-Responders, Catch All E-mail Address, IMAP (Web Mail), <nowiki>NeoMail</nowiki> (Web Mail), Horde (Web Mail), Squirrel Mail (Web Mail), Spam Assassin, Custom Spam Filters, MX Record Modifications.

Ftp Features: FTP Access, FTP Manager, Custom FTP Messages, FTP Session Control, FTP Client Software, Web-FTP.

Statistics: Analog Web Statistics, Webalizer Web Statistics, Sub-Domain Statistics, Last 300 Visitor Details, Detailed Bandwidth Stats, Error Logs, Counters.

Internet Tools: Domain Lookup, Traceroute Tool, Manage <nowiki>OpenPGP</nowiki> keys, SSL Compatible (https), Search Engine Submitter, Website Builder Software, HTML Editor.

- - -

I'll write up the results later in a review. --JunkerIn, 040125
